 "remarks": "Enjoy the best of SONO living in this mostly updated, move-in-ready condo! Featuring brand-new stainless steel kitchen appliances, newer cabinets, brand-new flooring throughout, and fresh paint. This inviting home offers a bright, open floor plan that seamlessly connects the living and dining areas, making everyday living and entertaining a pleasure. An abundance of natural light fills this corner unit, while sliders lead to your own private deck, complete with an exterior storage closet. Storage is plentiful throughout, including a generous entry coat closet, linen closets in both bathrooms, and two large closets in each bedroom. The spacious primary bedroom features its own full bath, while the second bedroom offers excellent closet space as well. An in-unit laundry room adds to the convenience.  Additional amenities include elevator access to the covered, gated parking garage, with assigned parking space #7, as well as ample guest parking.  Location is everything! Walk to the Metro-North train station and step out to SONO's vibrant selection of restaurants, bars, shops, and entertainment. The SoNo Collection Mall, I-95, and the beautiful Calf Pasture and Shady beaches are all just minutes away. Experience the best of both worlds: a convenient, walkable lifestyle paired with a peaceful,spacious place to call home! Please note: No pets permitted, per association bylaws.",
